OL,3,GNEWSA999 calls about tumble dryers
OL,4,Aafter wildfire alert
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Even things like are they still able
OL,7,Fto use devices in their houses such as
OL,8,Ftumble dryers," he added.
OL,10,FThe service urged people to only call
OL,11,F999 to report genuine emergencies, and
OL,12,Fto contact Firestoppers online or over
OL,13,Fthe phone if it is a general inquiry.
